  "title": "Upstream Shockwave Deliverable Provenance Propagation",
  "description": "The orchestrator shockwave dependency gate MUST propagate verified deliverable artifact paths (e.g. docs/eval/*.md) from upstream tasks into downstream task envelopes to prevent speculative kind guessing and permission errors.",
