  "title": "Reactive Tool-Denial & Permission Ambient Coaching",
  "description": "The swarm engine and tool guard MUST intercept permission denials and unknown object kinds, returning actionable ambient coaching and guidance instead of silent coordinator errors or tripping tool_denial_guard aborts.",
